came from the user, say so plainly.\\\\r\\\\n- **A workbook *you create* for someone to fill in** needs a short legend 
naming which cells to edit, and one example row of realistic values showing the expected format. Never add such a row 
to a file you were asked to edit.\\\\r\\\\n- **Editing an existing file: match its conventions exactly.** They 
