clean\\\\r\\\\nworkbook.\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n**A green recalc proves your formulas *evaluate*, not that they are 
*right*.** An off-by-one\\\\r\\\\nrange or a reference to the wrong row yields a clean, error-free file with wrong 
numbers.\\\\r\\\\nWrite 2–3 formulas first and check they pull the values you expect, before building out a 
